 s\, New Student Convocation\, LLC events\, commuter experiences. Every eve
 nt node currently reads 'No dates or times currently scheduled.'\n\nOUTREA
 CH NOTE: The Involvement Fair and Cranberry Fest are club-only\, no outsid
 e vendors. Historic venue for both: Campus Mall (rain site Student Recreat
 ion Center). Note Alumni Gymnasium was renamed Canastra Hammer Arena in Ju
 ne 2026.\n\nSOURCE: https://www.rider.edu/about/events/welcome-week\n\n(Co
