BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rider-externalaccessthecospons-2faf02f695@nascentmaterials.com
DTSTAMP:20260811T192217Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:[minor] Rider - External access: the co-sponsorship route is the ch
 eapest door
LOCATION:Conference Services\, Rider University
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: minor\n\nThree routes for an outside org: (1) Career Dev
 elopment for the sanctioned employer channel\; (2) Conference Services to 
 rent space - conferences@rider.edu\, 609-896-7700 opt. 2\, requires a faci
 lities usage agreement plus a Rider-approved COI at least 7 days before\, 
 catering exclusive to Gourmet Dining\; (3) get a Rider student org or depa
 rtment to co-sponsor\, which reclassifies the event as internal - no fee\,
  no contract\, no COI\, with final approval from Campus Life. Route 3 is t
 he cheapest door. The July 15 external deadline for fall locations has pas
 sed but reads as a priority deadline\, not a hard bar - worth calling.\n\n
 OUTREACH NOTE: External groups CANNOT self-serve 25Live. If minors are inv
 olved the COI must explicitly cover sexual molestation/assault/harassment 
 claims.\n\nSOURCE: https://www.rider.edu/about/offices-services/facilities
 -university-operations/auxiliary/conference-services\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-
 10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:Rider\,minor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
